{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le05ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le05ob10re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn10le05ob10re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn10le05ob10re2img01.jpg", "text": "The Shimunenga hasn't begun yet! The women's traditional leopard skin clothing needs to be brought out. It needs to be carefully looked at. Here and there, the clothing requires mending or cleaning. Every woman wants to be told that her garment is beautiful. The young women need instructing on how to dance.<br/>Have you recently arrived in Namwala? Have you ever wanted to experience the Shimunenga? Have you only just been told it happens this weekend? How much have you found out so far? I haven't been to one myself up to now!", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn10le05ob10re2img02.jpg", "text": "Has the first rain of the season just fallen? Yes, it has! That's why the ceremony takes place this weekend. Also because the full moon hasn't arrived up to now. Both of these are required to happen before the ceremony can begin.  <br/>On Friday, the women sing and dance, while the men stay in the villages, to relax and focus on land affairs that require discussing. <br/>On Saturday, the men's day, the women bring sticks, which symbolize spears that need to be thrown at the men. There are dances that need doing and songs that need singing.", "time": "37000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn10le05ob10re2img03.jpg", "text": "Appreciation gifts are required to be given to performers. Then, people move to the chief\u0092's palace for speeches and praise songs. This is a time for songs and games.<br/>On Sunday, the best cattle from each family are displayed to impress the neighbors. After that, there are other games, dancing, and 